      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature within 30 feet Casts a Spell or uses an ability with the fortune or misfortune trait\n\n---\nEffect The astronomer's rejection of such fantasy becomes manifest. The astronomer attempts to counteract the triggering effect with a counteract modifier of +9 and a counteract rank of 1."
